WEBVTT

01:31.699 --> 01:34.240
[Episode 31]

01:55.239 --> 01:56.920
Black Bird eternal!

01:56.920 --> 01:58.560
Blood Moon forever!

01:58.560 --> 02:00.959
Welcome back, Your Highness!

02:00.959 --> 02:02.659
You may all rise.

02:23.599 --> 02:26.240
I have waited over ten years.

02:26.240 --> 02:29.960
Finally, Your Highness has returned.

02:29.960 --> 02:31.460
You are

02:32.439 --> 02:33.939
the old clan chief?

02:40.360 --> 02:43.139
Is it truly you, Your Highness?

02:45.120 --> 02:48.620
You have truly returned.

02:50.879 --> 02:57.120
Of the twelve clan elders, now only I remain.

02:57.120 --> 03:00.240
Your Highness still remembers me.

03:00.240 --> 03:06.300
Now I can die in peace.

03:18.000 --> 03:22.400
Please drop your blood on the clan register
and offer it to the altar.

03:22.400 --> 03:24.159
Then swear before the Black Bird

03:24.159 --> 03:26.039
[Clan Register]
you'd restore our kingdom

03:26.039 --> 03:29.099
to comfort the souls of the tragic dead.

03:33.599 --> 03:35.080
Your Highness returns!

03:35.080 --> 03:36.800
May we restore our land!

03:36.800 --> 03:38.319
Your Highness returns!

03:38.319 --> 03:39.960
May we restore our land!

03:39.960 --> 03:41.439
Your Highness returns!

03:41.439 --> 03:43.560
May we restore our land!

03:43.560 --> 03:45.500
Ancestors above,

03:46.400 --> 03:51.979
I, Murong Yao, though unworthy of this line,
command as the princess:

03:53.520 --> 03:57.379
the state of Zhongwan
shall never be re-established.

04:01.400 --> 04:03.400
Your Highness!

04:03.400 --> 04:06.240
Your Highness, you've shattered
the hope of Zhongwan's people.

04:06.240 --> 04:08.479
To not restore our kingdom
is to betray our ancestors.

04:08.479 --> 04:11.719
Living is more important
than memorial tablets.

04:11.719 --> 04:14.060
I only want to save the people of Zhongwan.

04:22.879 --> 04:24.639
Black Bird eternal!

04:24.639 --> 04:26.839
Blood Moon forever!

04:26.839 --> 04:29.800
When I stain the altar with my blood,

04:29.800 --> 04:34.519
the Black Bird will awaken completely.

04:34.519 --> 04:35.920
Black Bird eternal!

04:35.920 --> 04:37.560
Blood Moon forever!

04:37.560 --> 04:39.279
We beg the Black Bird to open its eyes

04:39.279 --> 04:41.939
and grant Her Highness
the will to restore our kingdom.

04:45.480 --> 04:46.759
Your Highness,

04:46.759 --> 04:50.560
the old clan chief's two sons
both died in battle over ten years ago.

04:50.560 --> 04:53.000
His grandson died
on a snowy night while fleeing.

04:53.000 --> 04:55.199
And he cried himself blind.

04:55.199 --> 04:58.800
All these years, his only reason to live

04:58.800 --> 05:01.600
was to see Your Highness one last time.

05:01.600 --> 05:05.300
Because he firmly believed
that Your Highness would return.

05:14.399 --> 05:16.879
For the other two
who volunteered to sacrifice themselves,

05:16.879 --> 05:20.560
one had a son who died
building canals for the Ning Empire,

05:20.560 --> 05:24.899
and the other had his entire family
buried alive when our kingdom fell.

05:26.480 --> 05:28.371
My entire Shangguan family

05:29.560 --> 05:32.259
all died at the hands of the Ning people.

05:34.000 --> 05:36.699
Without the faith of restoration
to sustain us,

05:37.439 --> 05:39.486
among all of us here,

05:40.408 --> 05:43.060
not one could survive until now.

05:55.120 --> 05:57.720
Your Highness, please get changed.

05:57.720 --> 06:01.899
The princess of Zhongwan should not wear
the robes of an enemy queen.

06:18.920 --> 06:21.639
Zhongwan attire suits Your Highness better.

06:21.639 --> 06:24.339
Come, pay respects to our ancestors.

06:29.839 --> 06:31.660
Ancestors above,

06:32.560 --> 06:36.459
I, unworthy descendant Murong Yao,
have come too late.

06:37.120 --> 06:40.439
To grant the people of Zhongwan
peace and prosperity

06:40.439 --> 06:43.139
is my duty as the princess.

06:44.279 --> 06:48.160
I'll never let war fall on Zhongwan again.

06:48.160 --> 06:51.480
Your Highness, swear to the ancestors quickly

06:51.480 --> 06:55.019
that you will restore our kingdom
and reclaim the realm.

07:00.279 --> 07:03.898
Yin Qing, doesn't letting the people
live in peace

07:03.898 --> 07:06.160
matter more than killing for restoration?

07:06.160 --> 07:08.319
I have brought you back safely.

07:08.319 --> 07:10.560
It's time for me to walk the path I must.

07:10.560 --> 07:12.279
What is Your Highness going to do?

07:12.279 --> 07:15.000
Ning has abolished
the perpetual servitude law.

07:15.000 --> 07:17.160
The new policies will go through.

07:17.160 --> 07:19.959
I shall return to Ning
as the princess of Zhongwan

07:19.959 --> 07:22.480
and negotiate peace with the Emperor of Ning

07:22.480 --> 07:24.680
to seek a way forward for Zhongwan's people.

07:24.680 --> 07:27.079
Do you know what the Wannu Camp
is going through?

07:27.079 --> 07:29.399
Do you think that a few new policies
from Ying Gua

07:29.399 --> 07:32.279
can erase the suffering and humiliation
of the Zhongwan people?

07:32.279 --> 07:35.079
How has the Ning Empire
treated us all these years?

07:35.079 --> 07:37.147
When the day of restoration comes,

07:37.147 --> 07:40.680
they must pay all the debts.

07:40.680 --> 07:45.399
Restoring the kingdom
is your obsession, not mine.

07:45.399 --> 07:47.800
I only want to save my people.

07:47.800 --> 07:52.313
Sir, perhaps we can resolve this
without bloodshed

07:52.313 --> 07:54.019
in exchange for Zhongwan's peace--

07:56.720 --> 07:58.220
Get out.

08:03.920 --> 08:05.759
You are the princess of Zhongwan.

08:05.759 --> 08:07.959
What will it take for you
to come to your senses?

08:07.959 --> 08:09.360
You'll restore our kingdom.

08:09.360 --> 08:11.160
Come, say it to the ancestors.

08:11.160 --> 08:12.439
You'll restore our kingdom.

08:12.439 --> 08:13.560
You'll restore our kingdom!

08:13.560 --> 08:14.759
You'll restore our kingdom!

08:14.759 --> 08:17.540
You'll restore our kingdom!

08:34.399 --> 08:35.899
Yao.

08:53.320 --> 08:55.059
You're bleeding.

08:58.360 --> 08:59.940
I'll join you.

09:08.360 --> 09:10.320
Yin Qing, are you crazy?

09:10.320 --> 09:11.820
I'm not crazy.

09:12.799 --> 09:16.399
I am Shangguan Zhao, your Shangguan.

09:16.399 --> 09:20.279
My Shangguan died over ten years ago.

09:20.279 --> 09:23.899
The one alive is the Yin Qing
who gave me the Rain Bell

09:24.639 --> 09:28.379
and told me
that even the fiercest storm will pass.

09:33.559 --> 09:36.600
There is no Yin Qing in this world at all.

09:36.600 --> 09:38.279
To restore our kingdom,

09:38.279 --> 09:41.759
I can even grovel and flatter Ying Gua.

09:41.759 --> 09:44.860
No one can stop my cause
of restoring our kingdom,

09:50.559 --> 09:52.220
including you.

09:57.320 --> 09:58.915
Your path

10:00.082 --> 10:02.759
leads to nothing but a grave for everyone.

10:02.759 --> 10:04.860
No matter how hard the path I seek,

10:06.000 --> 10:08.220
it's still a path for the living.

10:12.360 --> 10:13.860
Guards.

10:31.919 --> 10:33.419
Yao,

10:34.120 --> 10:38.159
after we kill Ying Gua
and destroy the Ning imperial family,

10:38.159 --> 10:40.059
we will go play hide-and-seek,

10:41.039 --> 10:42.860
just like when we were children.

10:53.320 --> 10:55.519
I'll leave the restaurant to you.
Keep the books as usual.

10:55.519 --> 10:58.419
If anyone important asks,
say I'm out of town to visit family.

10:59.639 --> 11:02.500
Ms. Yan, it's too dangerous
for you to go alone.

11:04.320 --> 11:06.440
Mr. Shen, you've come at the right time.

11:06.440 --> 11:07.720
Quick, persuade Ms. Yan.

11:07.720 --> 11:09.220
Zhao Cai.

11:14.159 --> 11:15.659
You're going to find her?

11:19.639 --> 11:21.159
That day, I drew my sword
for the Ning Empire.

11:21.159 --> 11:22.440
If she desires no restoration,

11:22.440 --> 11:24.000
I will never harm her in the slightest.

11:24.000 --> 11:25.679
What if she desires that?

11:25.679 --> 11:27.559
If I protect her and oppose you,

11:27.559 --> 11:29.700
will you kill me as well?

11:34.799 --> 11:36.460
There won't be such a day.

11:38.320 --> 11:41.600
If you dare harm her in the slightest,
I will never forgive you.

11:41.600 --> 11:43.488
I don't care whether
she is from Ning or Zhongwan.

11:43.488 --> 11:45.559
I only care about her.

11:45.559 --> 11:47.480
I'm going to find her right now.

11:47.480 --> 11:49.559
Fu Zhi,

11:49.559 --> 11:51.399
His Majesty will lead the campaign himself.

11:51.399 --> 11:52.899
I'll take you to her.

12:09.480 --> 12:11.980
Miss, you dropped your ink stick.

12:13.519 --> 12:15.019
Thank you, Miss.

12:17.960 --> 12:20.559
I planted this pot
of Fragrant Abundance myself.

12:20.559 --> 12:22.879
It's a gift for you.
You can place it on your desk,

12:22.879 --> 12:24.620
and it's best for calming the mind.

12:27.919 --> 12:30.620
Indeed, it smells good.

12:32.440 --> 12:33.919
<i>On our first day,</i>

12:33.919 --> 12:36.039
<i>let's turn this cheerless Censorate</i>

12:36.039 --> 12:38.639
<i>into the best local office, shall we?</i>

12:38.639 --> 12:40.139
<i>Alright.</i>

12:43.600 --> 12:47.360
You grew up in hardship,
yet you still achieved the Triple First.

12:47.360 --> 12:49.500
I am truly filled with admiration.

12:50.879 --> 12:53.779
I don't know how to express my feelings.

12:55.840 --> 13:01.059
I only hope these items
can warm the coldness of your past.

13:07.279 --> 13:10.659
Zhi Li, there's no need to cry.

13:11.559 --> 13:12.879
It's all in the past.

13:12.879 --> 13:14.580
Everything ahead is new.

13:23.279 --> 13:25.799
If you believe he's a good man,

13:25.799 --> 13:27.940
why not give each other a chance?

13:30.120 --> 13:31.779
He is so good.

13:33.279 --> 13:36.960
I always feel that I don't deserve him.

13:36.960 --> 13:39.879
Meng, tell me,

13:39.879 --> 13:42.480
why did I agree to this marriage
in the first place?

13:42.480 --> 13:46.100
When a person is in extreme pain,
they always need to find support.

13:46.759 --> 13:50.080
And Nian is the lamp
that guides you forward in the fog.

13:50.080 --> 13:52.120
Because you know each other,

13:52.120 --> 13:54.500
and he can give you
the peace of mind you need.

13:55.639 --> 13:57.360
But I do care about him.

13:57.360 --> 13:58.919
I can't stand to see him hurt.

13:58.919 --> 14:00.919
I can bear to see him sad
because of me even less.

14:00.919 --> 14:02.399
You don't need to feel guilty.

14:02.399 --> 14:05.720
I just hope you can slowly
let down your guard.

14:05.720 --> 14:07.740
Nian is worth it.

14:20.559 --> 14:22.919
This is the farewell wine.

14:22.919 --> 14:24.419
You want to stop me?

14:40.639 --> 14:42.559
I trust her.

14:42.559 --> 14:47.179
Even as a remnant of Zhongwan,
she will not harm the Ning Empire.

14:48.480 --> 14:52.519
Nian, I want to go on the campaign with you

14:52.519 --> 14:54.019
to find Meng.

14:54.840 --> 14:57.679
Zhi Li, no matter how deep
your personal friendship is,

14:57.679 --> 15:00.039
you can't let personal feelings
interfere with state affairs.

15:00.039 --> 15:01.960
The front line is dangerous.

15:01.960 --> 15:04.519
Miss Yan and Zhi Shu will be in charge
of the grain escort.

15:04.519 --> 15:06.679
They can avoid the battlefield danger,

15:06.679 --> 15:09.980
but I must be at the front line personally.

15:11.320 --> 15:12.639
If you accompany me,

15:12.639 --> 15:14.159
whenever the beacon fires are lit,

15:14.159 --> 15:16.279
I will first think of your safety

15:16.279 --> 15:17.820
and get distracted.

15:21.519 --> 15:23.620
But I'm really worried about Meng,

15:29.320 --> 15:30.820
and you too.

15:37.879 --> 15:39.799
Zhi Li,

15:39.799 --> 15:41.299
now,

15:45.639 --> 15:47.460
do you like me even a little?

16:03.679 --> 16:05.179
You said

16:06.399 --> 16:08.320
this peach wood brings good luck

16:08.320 --> 16:10.139
and protects the wearer.

16:11.840 --> 16:13.340
Wear it.

16:17.000 --> 16:18.899
I want you to come back safely.

16:21.639 --> 16:23.139
I understand.

16:25.960 --> 16:27.840
I will set out at the hour of Yin tomorrow.

16:27.840 --> 16:30.179
I won't disturb you tonight.

16:32.919 --> 16:34.419
Nian.

16:47.080 --> 16:48.580
Zhi Li.

17:48.519 --> 17:49.759
My lady,

17:49.759 --> 17:53.160
before the Marquis left,
he instructed us to take good care of you.

17:53.160 --> 17:55.359
This morning, we heard you cough a little.

17:55.359 --> 17:58.279
And with the weather
getting colder these days,

17:58.279 --> 18:00.400
we've prepared some cold medicine.

18:00.400 --> 18:02.420
It dispels the cold and boosts you.

18:03.296 --> 18:07.654
[Nine Nine Nine Cold Medicine]

18:48.559 --> 18:50.000
Your Highness still wants to escape?

18:50.000 --> 18:53.119
I'm going to find a way
for Zhongwan's people.

18:53.119 --> 18:54.960
Mr. Shangguan has ordered

18:54.960 --> 18:56.519
that if Your Highness escapes,

18:56.519 --> 18:59.319
all the guards and maids
watching over Your Highness

18:59.319 --> 19:01.400
will be sent to the Wannu Camp.

19:01.400 --> 19:04.759
There, bodies pile up
at the alley entrances every day.

19:04.759 --> 19:08.140
Some were strangled at the city gate

19:09.000 --> 19:12.380
for no more than taking half a moldy pancake.

19:13.319 --> 19:17.599
I hope Your Highness will let them live.

19:17.599 --> 19:19.779
If you truly regard me as the princess,

19:21.319 --> 19:26.319
why does every word I say
not match a single threat from him?

19:26.319 --> 19:28.180
These past few days back in Zhongwan,

19:29.519 --> 19:31.799
I always dream of Yin Qing.

19:31.799 --> 19:33.339
In the three years

19:34.480 --> 19:36.779
he was by my side in the Censorate,

19:38.480 --> 19:40.500
always smiling and joking,

19:41.599 --> 19:43.220
making witty remarks

19:44.759 --> 19:47.279
and finding ways to make me laugh.

19:47.279 --> 19:50.779
Every day, he cooked a table full of dishes,

19:51.640 --> 19:54.079
saying it was to reward me and Zhi Li.

19:54.079 --> 19:55.940
Whenever there was danger,

19:56.559 --> 19:59.519
he would always shield us without hesitation.

19:59.519 --> 20:01.400
How could someone like that

20:01.400 --> 20:04.079
have become like this now?

20:04.079 --> 20:05.680
Your Highness,

20:05.680 --> 20:10.059
Mr. Shangguan
is a man of kindness at his core.

20:14.559 --> 20:16.339
You have feelings for him?

20:18.759 --> 20:20.480
When Zhongwan fell,

20:20.480 --> 20:23.000
I was sent to Qingzhou as a slave,

20:23.000 --> 20:27.119
taken in by that beast of a magistrate
as a household prostitute,

20:27.119 --> 20:28.740
tormented day and night.

20:29.720 --> 20:33.460
Those days were even more agonizing
than in the Wannu Camp.

20:38.720 --> 20:42.200
It was Mr. Shangguan who saved me
when I was most desperate

20:42.200 --> 20:44.480
and gave me a new identity,

20:44.480 --> 20:46.779
allowing me to live with dignity.

20:47.799 --> 20:51.740
No matter what he does,
I will stay by his side

20:52.880 --> 20:54.380
and support him.

21:04.599 --> 21:06.539
So you should help me even more

21:08.079 --> 21:10.500
to keep him from going down the wrong road.

21:12.319 --> 21:14.019
I want to go to the Wannu Camp.

21:16.200 --> 21:17.700
Take me there.

21:21.759 --> 21:22.880
- Hurry up!
- Stop drinking!

21:22.880 --> 21:25.420
- Go quickly!
- Get to work!

21:27.240 --> 21:28.680
- Get up!
- No slacking off!

21:28.680 --> 21:29.720
Hurry!

21:29.720 --> 21:31.039
- Get up!
- Be quick about it!

21:31.039 --> 21:32.160
I'm talking to you!

21:32.160 --> 21:34.000
Get up! Are you getting up?

21:34.000 --> 21:37.200
Your Highness,
the Wannu Camp is heavily guarded.

21:37.200 --> 21:39.000
We can only watch from afar.

21:39.000 --> 21:40.359
In the Wannu Camp,

21:40.359 --> 21:43.920
mining, building tombs, digging canals,

21:43.920 --> 21:46.039
wherever there is deadly labor,

21:46.039 --> 21:48.900
our Zhongwan people are driven to it.

21:49.839 --> 21:52.160
It has been over ten years.

21:52.160 --> 21:55.259
Mr. Shangguan tried bribing officials
and organizing escapes.

21:56.079 --> 21:58.599
But once branded with the slave mark,

21:58.599 --> 22:03.339
even to the ends of the earth,
one will be dragged back and executed.

22:04.079 --> 22:05.579
Your Highness,

22:07.720 --> 22:10.019
you are the only one

22:11.519 --> 22:14.059
who can give these people hope to live.

22:30.960 --> 22:34.279
Your Highness, for every day you delay,

22:34.279 --> 22:36.759
Zhongwan gains dozens more corpses.

22:36.759 --> 22:40.920
You've seen the Wannu Camp,
and you still won't restore our kingdom?

22:40.920 --> 22:45.779
If you can find a way
to avoid shedding any Zhongwan blood,

22:46.559 --> 22:48.960
I will resolve to restore our kingdom.

22:48.960 --> 22:50.720
As long as you and I are married,

22:50.720 --> 22:52.640
we can draw Beijian into the fray

22:52.640 --> 22:54.660
to charge into battle for us.

23:04.759 --> 23:06.759
I agree.

23:06.759 --> 23:09.079
But I have three conditions.

23:09.079 --> 23:13.640
First, all of Zhongwan shall obey my orders,

23:13.640 --> 23:15.039
including you.

23:15.039 --> 23:18.440
Second, the alliance with Beijian

23:18.440 --> 23:20.519
must be under my lead.

23:20.519 --> 23:24.259
Third, from now on,

23:25.240 --> 23:29.119
you shall no longer threaten me
with any person or any matter.

23:29.119 --> 23:30.619
I agree to all of them.

23:31.519 --> 23:33.019
Your Highness,

23:33.799 --> 23:35.420
you have finally awakened.

23:38.559 --> 23:42.160
I watched my father and mother die
before my eyes

23:42.160 --> 23:45.839
and saw the people of Zhongwan
branded with the slave mark of Ning.

23:45.839 --> 23:49.240
I am the last bloodline
of the Zhongwan royals.

23:49.240 --> 23:52.740
I'll take back our realm with my own hands.

23:56.319 --> 23:58.259
The Black Bird returns.

23:59.079 --> 24:02.960
I swear to follow Your Highness to the death.

24:02.960 --> 24:04.940
Since you acknowledge me as the princess,

24:06.160 --> 24:08.579
you should speak to me on your knees.

24:18.359 --> 24:20.160
I will not only be the princess.

24:20.160 --> 24:23.599
Since I'm the last of the Zhongwan royals,

24:23.599 --> 24:26.900
I will become
the first ever empress of Zhongwan.

24:28.839 --> 24:30.660
On the day of my coronation,

24:31.759 --> 24:34.299
it will be the time of our wedding.

24:36.319 --> 24:39.779
As you command.

24:44.920 --> 24:46.319
Yeqi has sent a treaty of alliance,

24:46.319 --> 24:48.200
and Taishui has sent their surrender.

24:48.200 --> 24:49.400
Di Nian, Zhi Shu,

24:49.400 --> 24:52.819
these two battles were fought
with the same mettle as the late marquis.

24:53.440 --> 24:56.539
- I'm honored to have not failed.
- General Di!

24:57.720 --> 24:58.720
Your Majesty,

24:58.720 --> 25:00.880
Beijian has blocked our grain route
for over seven days.

25:00.880 --> 25:03.359
The wounded are short on medicine,
and it's critical.

25:03.359 --> 25:04.920
Fu Zhi has contacted the prefectural guilds.

25:04.920 --> 25:06.640
They've agreed to pool resources.

25:06.640 --> 25:09.319
Your Majesty, I pledge everything I have.

25:09.319 --> 25:11.319
I will personally see to it that the supplies

25:11.319 --> 25:12.960
reach our army in time.

25:12.960 --> 25:14.640
If this war is lost,

25:14.640 --> 25:17.519
as the head of the trade routes,
you'll be the first to be purged.

25:17.519 --> 25:20.519
And all that you have painstakingly built
over the years will be lost.

25:20.519 --> 25:22.799
If the country is lost, what use is a home?

25:22.799 --> 25:25.279
I only hope this war can end soon

25:25.279 --> 25:27.519
and I can meet Meng soon.

25:27.519 --> 25:30.559
The first herbs will be at the camp
in three days.

25:30.559 --> 25:32.160
You see the larger cause, Miss Yan.

25:32.160 --> 25:34.319
On behalf of our soldiers, I thank you.

25:34.319 --> 25:36.832
Zhi Shu, escort Miss Yan
through the western canyon

25:36.832 --> 25:38.839
to gather supplies and protect her safety.

25:38.839 --> 25:41.095
I will ensure she is unharmed.

25:41.095 --> 25:43.400
Your Majesty, urgent report!

25:43.400 --> 25:45.279
The Zhongwan rebels
have sent a message by arrow,

25:45.279 --> 25:46.779
claiming that Miss Meng...

25:47.440 --> 25:48.440
Say it.

25:48.440 --> 25:49.440
[Urgent Report]

25:49.440 --> 25:52.299
Miss Meng intends to declare herself empress
and establish her own rule.

25:54.960 --> 25:56.319
Beijian cuts off our army's grain.

25:56.319 --> 25:57.839
Zhongwan shakes our morale.

25:57.839 --> 25:59.759
They want to put Your Majesty in a bind
both inside and out.

25:59.759 --> 26:02.759
Your Majesty, we must strike first
to uproot the threats entirely.

26:02.759 --> 26:04.000
Shen Zhi Shu.

26:04.000 --> 26:05.580
For generations, my family has vowed

26:05.580 --> 26:07.960
to protect His Majesty
and preserve the Ning Empire.

26:07.960 --> 26:11.359
Even if you hate me,
I must stand firm in my position today.

26:11.359 --> 26:13.079
As the princess, Meng Ting Hui

26:13.079 --> 26:15.519
is the hope for all Zhongwan people
to live on.

26:15.519 --> 26:17.640
Whether she becomes the empress or not,

26:17.640 --> 26:19.880
in the current situation,

26:19.880 --> 26:22.460
this may be her only choice.

26:24.759 --> 26:26.799
Even if Beijian and Zhongwan
form an alliance,

26:26.799 --> 26:28.299
we still have a countermeasure.

26:33.519 --> 26:35.359
Your brother's death in the Ning Empire

26:35.359 --> 26:37.559
[Beijian's First Prince]
was the doing of the Ning Emperor Ying Gua.

26:37.559 --> 26:39.279
Now that Yeqi has submitted

26:39.279 --> 26:41.559
and Taishui can hardly withstand it,

26:41.559 --> 26:43.440
only by joining forces

26:43.440 --> 26:46.240
can we resist the Ning Empire's
hundred thousand cavalry.

26:46.240 --> 26:49.440
Zhongwan has been destroyed for many years,

26:49.440 --> 26:51.400
and you are nothing but a stray dog.

26:51.400 --> 26:52.880
What do you have to bargain with us?

26:52.880 --> 26:57.299
Because the princess of Zhongwan
is Ying Gua's beloved.

26:58.279 --> 27:02.079
Moreover, she and I have long been betrothed

27:02.079 --> 27:04.019
and will be married soon.

27:06.440 --> 27:10.839
Shangguan Zhao, here in my tent,
with your empty words,

27:10.839 --> 27:13.799
you expect to win the trust
of my Beijian cavalry?

27:13.799 --> 27:16.960
You are merely the leader
of the Blood Moon Society.

27:16.960 --> 27:20.240
Beijian allies only with a true ruler.

27:20.240 --> 27:24.259
In that case, would you be willing
to ally with me, First Prince?

27:31.480 --> 27:34.480
Zhongwan has been destroyed for many years.

27:34.480 --> 27:36.319
What do you have
to propose an alliance with me?

27:36.319 --> 27:38.519
For the battle between Beijian and Ning,

27:38.519 --> 27:41.660
let me teach you how to win.

27:43.519 --> 27:46.021
<i>He will deploy heavy troops here,</i>

27:46.021 --> 27:48.920
[Jinxia Pass]
so we should take Xigu Pass.

27:48.920 --> 27:50.759
Kill!

27:50.759 --> 27:52.880
Beijian will detour through Xigu Pass.

27:52.880 --> 27:55.640
Di Nian, lead your troops
to intercept the enemy's pursuit.

27:55.640 --> 27:57.960
<i>Xigu Pass is weakly defended.
Why would Your Majesty--</i>

27:57.960 --> 27:59.599
<i>Precisely because it is weakly defended,</i>

27:59.599 --> 28:01.680
it will be her choice.

28:01.680 --> 28:03.519
She knows I will set an ambush
on the trade route,

28:03.519 --> 28:05.319
and I know she'll take an unexpected way.

28:05.319 --> 28:09.240
How do you, the princess of Zhongwan,
know the deployment of the Ning army?

28:09.240 --> 28:13.319
Because he has calculated
that I will calculate every move of his.

28:13.319 --> 28:15.079
If you want to win,

28:15.079 --> 28:19.039
you must make him think
everything is under his control.

28:19.039 --> 28:22.680
In this world, no one knows her thoughts
better than I.

28:22.680 --> 28:25.720
Tonight, I will lead elite troops
to personally scout the enemy camp.

28:25.720 --> 28:28.940
- Di Nian.
- I will lead troops to make a feint.

28:55.480 --> 28:58.720
Fu Zhi, you haven't eaten or drunk all day
while gathering supplies.

28:58.720 --> 29:00.220
Eat something.

29:01.319 --> 29:02.680
I'm not hungry.

29:02.680 --> 29:04.480
Must we be like this?

29:04.480 --> 29:07.920
Since you raised your sword against Meng
in the Sacred Ancestral Hall,

29:07.920 --> 29:09.460
is there still 'we'?

29:12.279 --> 29:14.342
Shen Zhi Shu,

29:14.342 --> 29:16.819
you know full well
how important Meng is to me.

29:22.319 --> 29:23.920
My mother died early.

29:23.920 --> 29:25.180
Growing up,

29:25.180 --> 29:27.960
only Meng stayed with me and cherished me.

29:27.960 --> 29:29.359
If it weren't for her being with me,

29:29.359 --> 29:31.660
I would have gone with my mother long ago.

29:32.880 --> 29:37.440
Yet you actually had the heart to kill her.

29:37.440 --> 29:39.063
Fu Zhi,

29:39.063 --> 29:41.638
I am not just your Shen Zhi Shu.

29:41.638 --> 29:44.000
And my sword was not pointed
at your Meng that day

29:44.000 --> 29:45.819
but at the princess of Zhongwan,

29:46.480 --> 29:50.640
a traitor who intended to destroy the court
and the Ning Empire.

29:50.640 --> 29:52.319
Meng has done so much good
for the Ning Empire.

29:52.319 --> 29:53.920
You know it better than anyone.

29:53.920 --> 29:55.319
Shen Zhi Shu, tell me,

29:55.319 --> 29:57.640
do you truly believe
that Meng would betray the Ning Empire

29:57.640 --> 29:59.119
and harm His Majesty?

29:59.119 --> 30:00.480
Under the eyes of everyone,

30:00.480 --> 30:03.079
if you were me, what choice would you make?

30:03.079 --> 30:05.079
Defying His Majesty

30:05.079 --> 30:06.579
and betraying the Ning Empire

30:07.599 --> 30:09.099
like Meng Ting Hui?

30:12.559 --> 30:13.640
Fu Zhi.

30:13.640 --> 30:15.140
Leave me alone.

30:28.359 --> 30:31.119
Fu Zhi, I know

30:31.119 --> 30:33.000
you hate me for this.

30:33.000 --> 30:35.579
If hating me makes you feel better,

30:37.440 --> 30:39.460
you can hate me for as long as you want.

30:44.519 --> 30:46.680
It's not that I'm unwilling to walk with you.

30:46.680 --> 30:48.553
It's just that behind me,

30:48.553 --> 30:50.799
there's the Shen family's
central legacy of honor and loyalty

30:50.799 --> 30:53.740
and the peace that Ning's soldiers
bought with their blood.

31:00.039 --> 31:02.740
I... I do hate you.

31:03.519 --> 31:06.279
I hate that you don't understand
Meng's helplessness.

31:06.279 --> 31:07.359
I hate you

31:07.359 --> 31:11.180
for putting your cold stance
above our feelings.

31:13.559 --> 31:15.880
I hate that you are right.

31:15.880 --> 31:19.880
But I still hate you. I just hate you.

31:19.880 --> 31:22.220
Protecting the Ning Empire is my duty.

31:23.160 --> 31:24.660
And protecting you

31:25.799 --> 31:27.500
is my instinct.

31:42.839 --> 31:45.119
East gate under attack! Quickly reinforce!

31:45.119 --> 31:47.720
- Let's go!
- Quick!

31:47.720 --> 31:49.220
Hurry!

32:19.039 --> 32:20.539
Who set the fire?

32:22.279 --> 32:25.240
Your Highness,
Shadow Guards have raided the grain camp.

32:25.240 --> 32:27.140
It must be the men sent by Ying Gua.

32:29.519 --> 32:30.880
Someone is retreating to the east gate.

32:30.880 --> 32:32.380
After them!

32:34.759 --> 32:35.880
Your Highness.

32:35.880 --> 32:37.400
Your Highness's safety matters most.

32:37.400 --> 32:38.940
Please stay behind to coordinate.

32:51.160 --> 32:52.700
Is it true?

32:53.799 --> 32:55.240
It is true.

32:55.240 --> 32:57.460
Are you really going to marry Shangguan Zhao

32:58.200 --> 32:59.440
and declare yourself empress?

32:59.440 --> 33:03.200
My clansmen were bullied and killed
by Ning soldiers.

33:03.200 --> 33:05.440
Every night when I close my eyes,

33:05.440 --> 33:09.000
a hundred thousand dead souls
are weeping and questioning me in my ears,

33:09.000 --> 33:10.859
"Murong Yao,

33:12.680 --> 33:15.039
why don't you fight?"

33:15.039 --> 33:16.779
If you were me,

33:17.480 --> 33:19.539
how would you choose?

33:21.200 --> 33:23.700
There's never a way to have both.

33:25.440 --> 33:27.599
You love the Ning Empire,

33:27.599 --> 33:29.539
and I love Zhongwan.

33:30.200 --> 33:33.140
On the day of our wedding, you let me go.

33:34.359 --> 33:36.519
So today, I have never seen you either.

33:36.519 --> 33:38.019
From now on,

33:39.200 --> 33:40.700
we are even.

33:54.200 --> 33:55.680
Your Majesty's strategy was brilliant.

33:55.680 --> 33:58.359
First you burned Beijian's grain
and threw them into disarray.

33:58.359 --> 34:00.720
Then you had our army
switch to soft gold-thread armor

34:00.720 --> 34:02.599
and set an ambush at Xigu Pass
to encircle the enemy,

34:02.599 --> 34:04.960
leading to the complete rout
of Beijian's main force.

34:04.960 --> 34:06.635
Beijian lost the first battle badly.

34:06.635 --> 34:08.320
They will counterattack with full force.

34:08.320 --> 34:10.079
We must not let our guard down.

34:10.079 --> 34:11.579
Yes!

34:13.742 --> 34:15.300
Shangguan Zhao,

34:16.280 --> 34:17.800
where is Meng Ting Hui?

34:17.800 --> 34:19.139
She's at the temporary palace,

34:19.139 --> 34:20.559
preparing for the coronation ceremony.

34:20.559 --> 34:22.119
In the battle of Xigu Pass,

34:22.119 --> 34:25.445
you caused Beijian
to lose troops and commanders.

34:25.445 --> 34:28.599
Tell me, has your princess
colluded with the Ning Empire?

34:28.599 --> 34:31.800
Your Highness,
losses are to be expected in battle.

34:31.800 --> 34:34.440
Isn't making rash accusations
before the truth is clear

34:34.440 --> 34:36.420
way too arbitrary?

34:38.199 --> 34:40.559
Shadow Guards of Ning
retreated to the west gate,

34:40.559 --> 34:43.159
and you claimed it was the east gate.

34:43.159 --> 34:46.079
Tell me, are you secretly colluding
with the enemy?

34:46.079 --> 34:49.760
What I saw that night
was indeed the east gate.

34:49.760 --> 34:51.039
Your Highness,

34:51.039 --> 34:52.880
if she truly dares to collude with the enemy,

34:52.880 --> 34:54.480
I will personally finish her off.

34:54.480 --> 34:56.699
I will clean up your house for you!

34:59.079 --> 35:01.739
Mr. Shangguan, your hand!

35:05.000 --> 35:07.000
Shangguan Zhao,

35:07.000 --> 35:12.039
your dog has developed improper thoughts.

35:12.039 --> 35:15.099
Someone, take her away.

35:23.400 --> 35:26.440
Now that Ying Gua's forces
are all concentrated at Xigu Pass,

35:26.440 --> 35:28.880
why not take advantage of his lowered guard

35:28.880 --> 35:31.199
and strike at Jinxia Pass,
the throat of Ning?

35:31.199 --> 35:32.599
[Jinxia Pass]

35:32.599 --> 35:36.400
I want to make Ying Gua watch his realm

35:36.400 --> 35:38.980
turn into a sea of blood.

35:52.880 --> 35:55.039
What have you concealed for Her Highness?

35:55.039 --> 35:56.960
It has nothing to do with her.

35:56.960 --> 35:59.679
The Beijian people are wolves at heart,
never to be trusted.

35:59.679 --> 36:01.820
I don't want you to deal with the devil.

36:06.760 --> 36:10.039
As long as Ning falls,
I don't care what it takes.

36:10.039 --> 36:11.239
It was I who saved you

36:11.239 --> 36:13.320
and taught you swordsmanship.

36:13.320 --> 36:17.440
And now, of all people,
it's you who betrayed me.

36:17.440 --> 36:19.780
I don't want to watch you fall further.

36:21.400 --> 36:23.360
Look at yourself now.

36:23.360 --> 36:26.000
Are you still fighting for Zhongwan's people?

36:26.000 --> 36:30.719
You are filling your own selfish desires
with our people's blood.

36:30.719 --> 36:34.019
If you hate that Her Highness loves Ying Gua,
then go kill Ying Gua.

36:36.519 --> 36:39.840
But don't drag countless people
down with you.

36:39.840 --> 36:42.579
Don't think I won't kill you.

36:45.400 --> 36:48.119
My life was saved because of you.

36:48.119 --> 36:50.480
I'll return it to you.

36:50.480 --> 36:52.420
I'd willingly die

36:55.119 --> 36:57.019
by your hand.

37:04.320 --> 37:05.679
Get lost!

37:05.679 --> 37:07.780
Before I change my mind.

37:11.039 --> 37:13.019
Let's leave together,

37:13.760 --> 37:15.699
far away from these conflicts.

37:30.519 --> 37:32.599
<i>You all say I'm crazy,</i>

37:32.599 --> 37:34.159
<i>but if I weren't,</i>

37:34.159 --> 37:38.340
<i>how could I have endured
the hatred of over ten years?</i>
